# degenerate and rejected inputs: constant/identity functions, >6 inputs,
# unknown basis/model, non-bit parameters, undefined domain.
c0(a: u1) = 0
c1(a: u3) = 1
id6(a: u6) = a
gates c0
gates c1
gates id6
gates x
w() = 1
gates w
u(z: u2 in 5..3) = z
gates u
f(x: u8 in 0..15) = x*x
find f -1
cost f model nosuch
